{"unit_id":"Mzy123l__dsh-plugin-remote-access#card-zh","repo":"Mzy123l/dsh-plugin-remote-access","commit":"017c4b2720e8c38e84abeb7edb4db3e406b697fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 远程访问入口把本机 DSH 网页界面提供给手机或其他设备使用。宿主端读取 DSH 网页服务地址并转发请求，客户端在设置页集中管理远程访问参数。它支持按配置选择监听地址和端口、使用带令牌的网址或设置访问码进入，并为远程页面提供手机布局、手势、输入行为和外观选项。还可查看连接状态与缓存信息，并由配套 Android 外壳接收模型提问和任务结束通知。适合希望在手机或另一台设备上继续使用桌面 DSH 的用户；需要安装在运行 DSH 的电脑上。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2132","index.js:1377","client.js:2798","client.js:3429"]}
{"unit_id":"Mzy123l__dsh-plugin-remote-access#card-en","repo":"Mzy123l/dsh-plugin-remote-access","commit":"017c4b2720e8c38e84abeb7edb4db3e406b697fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Remote Access shares a local DSH web interface with other devices. It forwards requests and supports addresses, ports, token links, and an optional access code. Remote pages add phone layout, gestures, input, and appearance. The Android shell receives question and turn-finished notifications.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2132","index.js:1377","client.js:2798","client.js:3429"]}
